      "explanation": "Aniline on protonation forms anilinium ion, which is\nmeta-directing. So, a considerable amount of meta product is formed\nalongwith o-nitroaniline and p-nitroaniline.\n<br><br><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1kxhdusb7/b239e76d-d9b8-4577-90d3-5352880c86c2/79af2230-6310-11ec-b36d-0fa4fbfb1e31/file-1kxhdusb8.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1kxhdusb7/b239e76d-d9b8-4577-90d3-5352880c86c2/79af2230-6310-11ec-b36d-0fa4fbfb1e31/file-1kxhdusb8.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"JEE Main 2021 (Online) 24th February Morning Shift Chemistry - Compounds Containing Nitrogen Question 188 English Explanation\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1kxhdusb7/b239e76d-d9b8-4577-90d3-5352880c86c2/79af2230-6310-11ec-b36d-0fa4fbfb1e31/file-1kxhdusb8.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1kxhdusb7/b239e76d-d9b8-4577-90d3-5352880c86c2/79af2230-6310-11ec-b36d-0fa4fbfb1e31/file-1kxhdusb8.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1kxhdusb7/b239e76d-d9b8-4577-90d3-5352880c86c2/79af2230-6310-11ec-b36d-0fa4fbfb1e31/file-1kxhdusb8.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1kxhdusb7/b239e76d-d9b8-4577-90d3-5352880c86c2/79af2230-6310-11ec-b36d-0fa4fbfb1e31/file-1kxhdusb8.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1kxhdusb7/b239e76d-d9b8-4577-90d3-5352880c86c2/79af2230-6310-11ec-b36d-0fa4fbfb1e31/file-1kxhdusb8.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1kxhdusb7/b239e76d-d9b8-4577-90d3-5352880c86c2/79af2230-6310-11ec-b36d-0fa4fbfb1e31/file-1kxhdusb8.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\">\n<br><p>Nitrating mixture is mixture of conc. HNO<sub>3</sub>\nand a conc. H<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>4</sub>.</p>\n<p>When aniline is reacted with nitrating mixture ortho, meta and para\nnitroanilines are obtained.</p>\n<p>Aniline being basic in nature, reacts with acids to form anilinium ion\nwhich is meta directing.</p>"
